Task 3 — Download & Import

Extract it into:

Enterprise-HRMS/
└── backend/

Open the backend folder as a Gradle project in IntelliJ.

Let Gradle finish downloading dependencies before making changes.

Task 4 — Verify

Run the generated application without changing any code.

We want to confirm:

Java 25 toolchain works
Gradle builds successfully
Spring Boot starts successfully

If anything fails, we fix it before proceeding.

